    narr:narration """This hub gathers the calibration record for the Kestrelwood spectrograph as established on 20260717. QuillAshgrove reported [a specific frequency setting](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_1) and separately confirmed [cross-check against reference plates](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_2) spanning the full observing band. Two summary nodes consolidate these: one [naming the instrument](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_3) as a session-level settled fact, the other [restating the frequency and verification source](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_4) attributed back to Quill. A broader narrative node frames the [general practice of spectrograph calibration against reference plates](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_InstrumentCalibrationVerification) as the procedural context. All children are dated to the same session; no prior or competing calibration values appear. Content here is specific to this instrument, this frequency, and this verification method — queries about other instruments, other observing sessions, or calibration methodology beyond reference-plate verification are not served here.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_InstrumentCalibrationVerification> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "The Kestrelwood spectrograph is now calibrated at 88.4 MHz." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We verified the calibration against the June reference plates and it\nholds across the full observing band." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Instrument**: Kestrelwood spectrograph" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Calibration**: 88.4 MHz, verified against June reference plates" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_4> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Attribution split: the instrument-naming summary is assigned to the Session as principal, while the frequency-and-verification summary is re-attributed to QuillAshgrove — the same facts carry different provenance depending on which node is expanded." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_3> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_4> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The broader narrative node generalises the procedure beyond this session, framing calibration as a repeatable observatory practice — a different register from the specific dated claims made by Quill." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_InstrumentCalibrationVerification> ] ;
